  "answer": "I added a running page to your Running note. You'll find it under Page in the note.\n\nI put your 30 Strava runs into a table in the note first, so you can still see and edit them under Text. The page reads from that table.\n\nThe page shows:\n- **Summary:** total km, average pace, average heart rate and your longest run.\n- **Weekly chart:** distance per week for the last 12 weeks.\n- **Run list:** every run, newest first, with date, km, minutes, pace and heart rate.\n- **Log form:** a \"Log a run\" form that adds a new row to the table.\n\nI haven't opened it in the app, so I haven't seen how it looks.",
